emscripten: a single domain.

The runtime reserves the minor heaps of all the possible domains at
startup, which emscripten's mmap allocates and clears: 16 MB in wasm32,
256 MB in wasm64.  Max_domains is a constant before 5.3, and the runtime is
built once for programs with and without threads: no Domain.spawn (threads
work).

--- a/runtime/caml/domain.h
+++ b/runtime/caml/domain.h
@@
-#ifdef ARCH_SIXTYFOUR
+#if defined(__EMSCRIPTEN__)
+#define Max_domains 1
+#elif defined(ARCH_SIXTYFOUR)
 #define Max_domains 128
